                    188.0,
                    735.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The University of California supports reasonable pay rate equity (within 5%), resulting from the University's initially hiring new career employees at a rate of pay at least 5% higher than the pay of current career employees in the same hiring unit in the same classification and who are assigned the same duties. For the purposes of this Section, a hiring unit is equivalent to a layoff unit. When examining reasonable equity rate issues, the University and AFSCME shall consider the employees'",
            "block_bbox": [
                187,
                760,
                1124,
                956
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
