        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. The University will use the criteria in Section C.2, when setting the salaries of initial hires and the parties will use the Section C.2 criteria when assessing claims of salary rate equity. All criteria must be met to invoke the University's obligation to increase wages to within 5% of a new hire with a higher salary.",
